        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/495429?u=9d0bf7e5c07194485c7f81827005599ecced9712&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Merges the legacy CSS <code class=\"notranslate\">position-visibility: anchors-*</code> values into <code class=\"notranslate\">anchor-*</code>.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Verified that Safari 27 beta supports both:</p>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/495429/616943244-312fd519-1e50-4311-80f3-16af2851f960.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODMxMjMxOTYsIm5iZiI6MTc4MzEyMjg5NiwicGF0aCI6Ii80OTU0MjkvNjE2OTQzMjQ0LTMxMmZkNTE5LTFlNTAtNDMxMS04MGYzLTE2YWYyODUxZjk2MC5wbmc_.Ll_CW0eDWdPvxeyxr0sf_2YsqJa7Q8t1PKaC1VR5DFA\"><img width=\"797\" height=\"208\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/495429/616943244-312fd519-1e50-4311-80f3-16af2851f960.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODMxMjMxOTYsIm5iZiI6MTc4MzEyMjg5NiwicGF0aCI6Ii80OTU0MjkvNjE2OTQzMjQ0LTMxMmZkNTE5LTFlNTAtNDMxMS04MGYzLTE2YWYyODUxZjk2MC5wbmc_.Ll_CW0eDWdPvxeyxr0sf_2YsqJa7Q8t1PKaC1VR5DFA\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 208px;; aspect-ratio: 797 / 208; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px\" class=\"js-gh-image-fallback\"></a>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #29950.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4777198061\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-